title: $:/mf/gen/Panel/log panel
catalog: Panel
target: log panel
summary: The log panel type

!! Commands

* ``log:find`` — Log: jump to a revision by number or label
* ``log:first`` — Log: move the selection to the newest revision
* ``log:last`` — Log: move the selection to the oldest revision
* ``log:mark`` — Log: set or clear the selected revision label
* ``log:next`` — Log: move the selection down
* ``log:prev`` — Log: move the selection up
* ``log:prune`` — Log: prune history before the selected revision
* ``log:refresh`` — Log: refresh from the daemon
* ``log:revert`` — Log: revert what is selected, or a wider scope (${Object.keys(REVERTS).join(' / ')})
* ``log:rollback`` — Log: rollback to the selected revision
* ``log:toggle`` — Log: toggle a view flag (branch graph / the watcher’s revisions / the selected revision’s operations)
